B.a1R=new A.aB("Your pay grade, for example E-1 or O-3. Your base pay is set from it.","",null)
B.a0Q=new A.aB("The date you entered active duty for pay purposes. Also called your Pay Entry Base Date (PEBD). Printed as year, month, day (YYMMDD).","PEBD = Pay Entry Base Date",null)
B.a1O=new A.aB("How many full years of service count toward your pay.","YRS SVC = Years of Service",null)
