B.a1Q=new A.aB("Which military service you are in: Air Force, Army, Navy or Space Force.","",null)
B.a0O=new A.aB("A code number for the finance office that handles your pay. Each finance office has its own number.","ADSN = Accounting and Disbursing Station Number; DSSN = Disbursing Station Symbol Number",null)
B.a1n=new A.aB("The dates this statement covers, normally one calendar month. On a separation statement, the separation date shows here.","",null)
