B.a18=new A.aB("Everything in the Entitlements column added together.","",null)
B.a0S=new A.aB("Everything taken out of your pay this period: taxes, life insurance, your mid-month pay and similar items. Check that your marital status and exemptions are right, because they change how much tax is taken.",u.f,null)
B.a1Z=new A.aB("Everything in the Deductions column added together.","",null)
B.a1s=new A.aB("Money you set up to be sent automatically from your pay to someone else or somewhere else, such as a second bank account, an insurer, housing, or child support. Know what each one is for and when it ends. Reserve and National Guard members do not have allotments.","",null)
