B.a1g=new A.aB("Date Initially Entered Military Service. The date you first joined any military service. It is used only to decide which retirement plan you are under. If it looks wrong, see your personnel office; the finance office (DFAS) does not set this date.","DIEMS = Date Initially Entered Military Service; DFAS = Defense Finance and Accounting Service",null)
B.a0g=new A.aB("Which military retirement plan you are in: Final Pay, High-3, REDUX, CHOICE or Blended. It depends on your DIEMS date and, for some people, a choice they made. Anyone who joined on or after 1 January 2018 is in the Blended plan.","",null)
B.a0A=new A.aB("How much of this period\u2019s pay is subject to federal income tax.","",null)
